<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>High In Low Places</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Beach Weather</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Melt</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1zKnyGMHUfR8zAzBJRpz5w</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.170" end="00:14.340">Me and you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.340" end="00:17.220">Me and you are fireproof</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.220" end="00:19.690">Always try to blame my youth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.690" end="00:23.560">I just wanna be your muse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.560" end="00:25.540">Neon light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.540" end="00:28.220">Leads us to the end of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.220" end="00:31.080">'Cause I can see infinity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.080" end="00:34.500">In your eyes in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.500" end="00:39.660">You and I got some troubles we're facing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.660" end="00:45.950">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.950" end="00:50.980">Never mind all the tears that we wasted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.980" end="00:58.980">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.030" end="01:05.640">In your arms in your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.640" end="01:08.150">High in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.150" end="01:10.180">Wasted days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.180" end="01:12.790">Wasted 'till we're MIA</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.790" end="01:15.550">Stuck inside a desert haze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.550" end="01:19.430">I just want to slip away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.430" end="01:21.360">Neon nights</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.360" end="01:23.950">We're never gonna get this right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.950" end="01:26.690">But I can see infinity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.690" end="01:30.440">In your eyes in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.440" end="01:35.670">You and I got some troubles we're facing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.670" end="01:41.630">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.630" end="01:46.700">Never mind all the tears that we wasted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.700" end="01:54.700">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.890" end="02:01.570">In your arms in your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.570" end="02:04.030">High in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.030" end="02:05.530">Burn it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.350" end="02:08.020">I know we can ride it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.020" end="02:11.240">Float on supersonic clouds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.240" end="02:15.120">And live forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.120" end="02:16.620">Wide awake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.430" end="02:19.160">Slip into the getaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.160" end="02:22.690">Baby we will burn away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.690" end="02:28.900">Away forever forever forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.900" end="02:34.190">You and I got some troubles we're facing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.190" end="02:40.270">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.270" end="02:45.390">Never mind all the tears that we wasted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.390" end="02:53.390">I know we can make it staying high in low places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.620" end="02:58.960">In your arms in your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.960" end="03:02.960">Staying high in low places</p></div></body></tt>